window.WLREVIEWS={"updated":"2026-11-16","all":{"rating":4.9,"count":71},"listings":[{"key":"wonderland","name":"Wonderland RV Caravans","placeId":"ChIJfd_8yt1P1moRGgJHKZVWRjM","rating":4.9,"count":61,"writeReviewUrl":"https://search.google.com/local/writereview?placeid=ChIJfd_8yt1P1moRGgJHKZVWRjM","avatar":"data:image/png;base64,","reviews":[{"id":"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pOdFJ6ZHBkVU5WVVd4c01HZEpXVGxLWmpaSE4zYxAB","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pOdFJ6ZHBkVU5WVVd4c01HZEpXVGxLWmpaSE4zYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjNtRzdpdUNVUWxsMGdJWTlKZjZHN3c%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Oriana Miculi","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLTHx8b9qWZPpkG51mIEg0LLWqqzixe70a4kjy1fSHQPuvrbg=s64-c-rp-mo-br100","date":"2026-11-03T05:53:57.713Z","stars":5,"text":"We couldn’t be happier with our experience purchasing our caravan from\nWonderland RV Caravans!\nFrom the first moment to the final handover, everything was absolutely fantastic. The team went above and beyond to make sure we felt welcomed, supported and confident with our purchase.\nTheir professionalism, outstanding customer service and attention to detail truly made the difference.\nWe are so excited to start making beautiful memories with our new caravan.\nA huge thank you to the entire team for such a wonderful experience. We highly recommend\nWonderland RV Caravans\nto anyone looking for quality, reliability and exceptional service!","images":[],"reply":"Thank you so much for your wonderful feedback! We're thrilled to hear that you had such a fantastic experience with our team and that you're excited to create beautiful memories with your new caravan. Your recommendation means the world to us! Safe travels and happy adventures! 🌟🚐💖"},{"id":"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s1aGFpMHdjMm94TkdGU1EzcFdaemxETnpaM2NGRRAB","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2s1aGFpMHdjMm94TkdGU1EzcFdaemxETnpaM2NGRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOk5hai0wc2oxNGFSQ3pWZzlDNzZ3cFE%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"8FeetTravels","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVI3zSFNjFXBY0YO_vyEYedbOXO7cpJ6lT2t2UhuAHaX6Dq05vT=s64-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100","date":"2026-10-29T02:23:45.245Z","stars":5,"text":"We brought our Wonderland RV Amaroo back in 2024 prior to taking off around Australia, we have now lived in this van for over 2 years. Any modifications we wanted to make on their Demo van such as an extra water tank and ISI bike rack was no issues at all. Any minor issues we have had have been quickly sorted out any spare parts shipped to the next place we are heading.\n\nWe have loved the van so much we are in the process of building a new one with Wonderland, they are truly an amazing family owned business and we love being apart of the Wonderland family.\n\nWould highly recommend this company to build your ultimate off-road caravan to travel Australia in.","images":["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLctqX1SN5cP1rpC8gJcLB0Yl68kenfNGSkbKq5yzf88zwev_HJDNS1PHo_1rdcyC0p7jlcqKNYzYJaRJ9SDVM5Mz8K-XCvbE1ASqIF9Zev9u94qEIBGsaU1vDrivqevmuncCL_B9bF6FuxE=k-no","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLcmDeDMOkUzgx-M_KUM-IKkZkJ4Y-GnARy4HbSgTE8kmPdK0fzKMRcKQYFojNPDPbudb9Kypujf2YeVz7l5wOQnmUIZarglOIvro6h3WJxyR3UKyq4bBe_xl59Blx3MgWVlXU-EuYS7P6EZ=k-no"],"reply":"Thank you for sharing your wonderful experience with us! We're thrilled to hear that your Wonderland RV Amaroo has become your home and that our team was able to accommodate your modifications seamlessly. It's great to know that we've been able to support you on your journey with quick solutions and spare parts. We are excited to be building your new van together and are grateful to have you as part of the Wonderland family! Happy travels!"},{"id":"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tkUWVHZGZaekpGVTBSSGJUTjZRbk14Tm1sUVdXYxAB","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tkUWVHZGZaekpGVTBSSGJUTjZRbk14Tm1sUVdXYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkdQeGdfZzJFU0RHbTN6QnMxNmlQWWc%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Sean Bartlett","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLqsrBU6kc75rYoML0_k-TFNjZ6jt7wRJMGc6-0Y3367Pexhw=s64-c-rp-mo-br100","date":"2026-10-22T23:58:51.533Z","stars":5,"text":"From our first enquiry to picking up our Wonderland Amaroo 1806, the whole experience has been nothing short of amazing.\n\nWhat really sets Wonderland apart is not just the quality of the final product but the people behind the brand. It’s more than just a caravan company, it genuinely feels like one big family.\n\nWe absolutely love our Amaroo 1806! It’s given us the freedom to explore, make memories and enjoy the lifestyle we love.\n\nHighly recommend! 😃","images":["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLcrHEGnjqezvcLOVFdPSbQG2ngqlNE-CHd4O28CAxSEMnlsYrBvMw8HYA_W-cTXsizajkNKkOwXGURYr2zOQ2mUhWORnwrvqe8e3VATJb1tRDKiShAtqvbdpG9WtpumsKveNH_-FQyNCvDo=k-no","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLduqwXY2zGEemQnyhF0nubJ9mVaYChC47e7XyhItusrBVhRPuDmCAi2gr8IiPTclGZQnYP5MHtT06TmaPRtVMoyXSNJpXnWwejnnDmRzJSU5c6gZCvhdhOfANduZ3kOnOctkhaGcnDt3hLZ=k-no","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLdrIBpl-Jmkh5Lw0jqXeQndNslF8e9IyfQTGpELUXxAp0GMvNQM413DxmLk24hYkUJCFABV4SYwx0sXfWq24KpwLOIt6CeFNlw7rZS7RQDtCe2RU7p3LPMbfba-rKxIXGjptOvZdAVmP7Hs=k-no","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLdbFt5ucLWfV_V0y2DIoLi4oicb-hZSjBLfqmuuq8T6tPrUtaUpuNEF2ONSvinCxZJqSc5RuggnYSpX8UOfx9jl3LpDoenAykQDMXAqb9CrG8TleZ2uwMtyaYvizfI51JcPzv3Slh7QoKY=k-no"],"reply":"Thanks Sean, we are glad you are enjoying your Amaroo. Looking forward to where it takes you."},{"id":"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT205bloxWkZWakE0V0hWTVpVMURiRkJWV1MxSFEwRRAB","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT205bloxWkZWakE0V0hWTVpVMURiRkJWV1MxSFEwRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOm9nZ1ZFVjA4WHVMZU1DbFBVWS1HQ0E%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Matt Kennelly","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIacx_0jkHhxQO5e-_1lXliifx4Xn7kjAo_ReRP1kJuX33NGA=s64-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100","date":"2026-10-22T00:59:47.513Z","stars":5,"text":"We spent 2 years researching and looking for our 'perfect' van. After short listing a handful the final decision was an easy one. Australian made, off road and off grid abilities and outstanding quality led us to Wonderland RV. The purchasing experience was pressure free and we loved the ability to get factory updates with photos during the build.\n\nAfter 18 mths with our Amaroo 1709 if someone asked would we buy another I would not hesitate to say definitely yes.","images":[],"reply":"Hi Matt,\n\nThanks so much for taking the time to write this. Two years of research is a lot of homework, so it means a lot that the Amaroo came out on top.\n\nWe're glad the build updates and photos made the wait easier, and that the buying side felt relaxed. Hearing you'd buy another one after 18 months on the road is the best feedback we could ask for.\n\nEnjoy the 1709 and the trips ahead.\n\nThe Wonderland RV team"},{"id":"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xsVmIxTlVjMFIxZDFNeWNVUkZMWGxpV1V4dmVHYxAB","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xsVmIxTlVjMFIxZDFNeWNVUkZMWGxpV1V4dmVHYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOllVb1NUc0R1d1MycURFLXliWUxveGc%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Cassandra Chalk","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK4_YwOeGBPQZ2Bac_akgia4fzw4lrSijRBjf5RDUVLbl6yJA=s64-c-rp-mo-br100","date":"2026-10-21T23:59:56.072Z","stars":5,"text":"16 months living in our Wonderland Hornet full time, we have had a great experience with Wonderland from Purchasing our van all the way through our travels and the reliability of our van.","images":["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLcxl_tiI0MLJMX16UUgoHoxqO1KWqhmyJ9HIGEObwSYwYqdLgwqZ5Ln1T_6C2Y13-sUD6cpQncEQ8aJKfnQXcuZKaO2l6HtIuriiV97mnaZrQ57u9jm3xYHWqXp6DhxDDqWpUzTZeoSNciK=k-no"],"reply":"Hi Cassandra,\n\nThank you for the lovely review. Sixteen months living full time in your Hornet is a real test, so it's great to hear she's been reliable the whole way.\n\nWe're glad we could look after you from the purchase through to life on the road. Safe travels, and we hope to hear where the Hornet takes you next.\n\nThe Wonderland RV team"},{"id":"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2w5aVEwUTNTVXhZZUhBMGVXTkliWHBsTnkxdU5HYxAB","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2w5aVEwUTNTVXhZZUhBMGVXTkliWHBsTnkxdU5HYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOl9iQ0Q3SUxYeHA0eWNIbXplNy1uNGc%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Ed Faith","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKUcEItZ0CgNePKTN4F9IRWFz4OV2_Uj8aQMLQPl_b6sV9Yog=s64-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100","date":"2026-10-11T05:18:43.413Z","stars":5,"text":"We recently took delivery of our Wonderland RV Hornet 2106 family bunk van. It’s our third van (but first Wonderland), and boy are we impressed. As seasoned travellers we knew that we wanted a brand and a build that we could trust: the highest quality and best functionality. We’ve taken the van on a 2,000km, 2-week Offgrid shakedown and we are so impressed. Makes me wish I’d bought a Wonderland for our first van!\nThe design, the layout, the build quality and the workmanship is truly second none. And I loved how during the build we received weekly updates with photos on the progress of our van - which gave us so much confidence that we’d chosen the right builder.  If you’re thinking about a Wonderland for your next van, I recommend it wholeheartedly.","images":["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLfCyLwLjYFMOwpK4bANChrsYd9m3m9rS0nwQTUo8IYgVr7TKtdZZujk3iRpRDO_YIHGDnVHLCM3UMtnbwS984OCenCjwt0fjai71OXLOg7YirRvIBZ_od9p4oQByBWop3KMdeKK1lJP6B1w=k-no","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLd-V-YShGkpUnmDtjBZRnEvqwh4mKYgSmTsODEOuwrQtzKQ8ITpUdDBBAVJ8KVVjYA7FcMGP7OsNNNmfywECff_OC5KUz3sn8oCUo4n00x_AQpX-SqJMKljBuh145NL9zV6YnsFx3l7TGqR=k-no","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLeGKHfvSyv8uS7vzU5P7w8XZJMw6cF6GRN0mFOin9M9Z7LfpDKjqZ42Ui_8eP_0VFvIG1rQkKJK1oIHLB0f5tOK9h0NnsoA6ejqgFQa0BXSDSRV7BZRxjdcH55f4AH7UplwsuSO1kWLdsPR=k-no","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLdfHoe9g_5eoADk4jYpIUdwoZTFK7RyTQbsAEPEkRJRju0KXzAqZ4xdqNMIl9aR6b6g14U9gXyk9lDW3uMhUyAJaYU8XfgjNSyV-emi5ix0W57UORu_tUKAiaP42SXKL5DQ-oV079mRGwnr=k-no"],"reply":"Thank you so much for your amazing feedback! We're thrilled to hear that your Wonderland RV Hornet 2106 has exceeded your expectations and that you enjoyed the build process. It's great to have seasoned travellers like you choose Wonderland for your adventures. We can't wait to see where your travels take you next! 🏕️✨"},{"id":"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2kxd1ZITm5WR1ptWDNCdlQwcENYM001ZWs5WGQzYxAB","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2kxd1ZITm5WR1ptWDNCdlQwcENYM001ZWs5WGQzYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOi1wVHNnVGZmX3BvT0pCX3M5ek9Xd3c%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Nick Barnett","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUmEzYvmYUSI3WtUHc4e908L7rrEYARBDgHURpMNugjcA1TZN1S0Q=s64-c-rp-mo-br100","date":"2026-07-30T00:37:15.923Z","stars":5,"text":"We bought a Wonderland XTR 2300 in July 2026 and could not be happier. The build quality is extremely good and the whole experience was exceptional. A massive thanks to Wonderland, especially to Joy as she was amazing from day 1 right through to delivery. 5 out of 5 stars guys for your great work and attention to detail..!","images":["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLfNHPm7qinyc8k5ZzvjEuCJr2uKtuioxFRmJ4z-y7tx9orgbdnmrw8bSYmf3HbEJW7PBCjbiv69OafN1rkev0_si_h_vxzrEuZmX5acVkp_NOGdG8R0uGoBn8Fu30hgrIDDzcuuBhEZcLiz=k-no"],"reply":"Thanks Nick, this made our day. Joy will be chuffed to read it, she looks after people from the first conversation right through to handover and takes real pride in it. The XTR 2300 is a cracker of a van and we're glad the build quality has lived up to what you were expecting. Enjoy every trip in it, and give us a shout if you ever need anything. Welcome to the Wonderland family 🤍"},{"id":"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21oVk9FMTRWV0V4V1hObmVHNW5WRE5MWkZGU1NVRRAB","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21oVk9FMTRWV0V4V1hObmVHNW5WRE5MWkZGU1NVRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmhVOE14VWExWXNneG5nVDNLZFFSSUE%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"julian Randall","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKjCcLTWAWx2QX6FmZWhikYx3Q7cm9CHp1gQBrIUg3Ja81H-Q=s64-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100","date":"2026-07-04T13:15:18.330Z","stars":5,"text":"🚐🎉 We finally picked up our incredible Wonderland Hornet 2300 today… and wow, it has exceeded every expectation!\n\nThis isn’t just a caravan—it’s our home for the next two years as we set off to explore everything this amazing country has to offer. 🇳🇿🇦🇺\n\nOf course, we didn’t exactly keep it “standard” 😄\nWe went all out with the customisation:\n💧 Extra water tanks\n☀️ Loads of solar\n🍳 An extra foot in the kitchen\n📦 The huge front storage box\n…and plenty more thoughtful upgrades to make life on the road even better.\n\nThe quality, craftsmanship, and attention to detail are absolutely outstanding—you can really see the pride that’s gone into this build.\n\nA massive thank you to Joy Carbonilla Enso and the entire Wonderland team for working with us through all our additions and getting everything finished on time. We truly appreciate all your effort and advice along the way.\n\nAnd a special shout-out to Rob Penesse for an incredibly detailed and reassuring handover—we left feeling confident, excited, and ready to roll.\n\nTomorrow the adventure begins.\n\nTwo Kiwis and one adventure-loving Vizsla named Leo… Australia, here we come! 🇳🇿🐾🇦🇺\n\nIf you see us out on the road, come and say hello—we’d love to meet fellow travellers and members of the Wonderland community along the way.\n\nHere’s to the open road, new friendships, and the adventure of a lifetime! 🚐✨","images":[],"reply":"Hi Julian, thank you so much for this lovely review and for choosing the Hornet 2300 for your next two years of adventures! We love hearing that all your customisations, the extra water tanks, solar, kitchen extension and front storage box, came together exactly how you pictured them.\n\nWe'll be sure to pass this on to Joy and Rob, they'll be thrilled to know their effort made such a difference. Wishing you and your family an incredible time on the road. Safe travels, and don't be a stranger, we'd love to see where the Hornet takes you!\n\nThe Wonderland RV Team"},{"id":"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pCeU1GSXRSVE5TUzJwMmVUUkhaSG8xUkZWeldrRRAB","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pCeU1GSXRSVE5TUzJwMmVUUkhaSG8xUkZWeldrRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjByMFItRTNSS2p2eTRHZHo1RFVzWkE%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Brent harvey","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLoKEXqmJyF1sj0HQeVhJmN7FoF2CsnKyJ4T0WGg-lFI15bwg=s64-c-rp-mo-br100","date":"2026-07-01T06:14:49.891Z","stars":5,"text":"Seriously absolutely amazing vans and quality and finish,we are super proud to own a xtr1906 and making some beautiful memories in New Zealand, thank you wonderland ,hats off to you all","images":["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLd2lIqqkmMjPtZ5vkPuSKsaXLQtOkpvwAVcTYX_aHBk5cNe9eILhfDz-vOu8XgT7ICDulAaov-Np1P6piO5fNvgk_-DY3OqwuMhuoGV4cOfXVYcd4Hllkd72lS8KtHKAdhQjYQrTuNiXPf_=k-no","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLeqYylQF_9Tc9Ke73CKbPeuryZK3rEPytDc9Eqg6oqZpD_jZDLU7f-_sNubYdYYjeUagYz3y6m1UmdcE8J2mGQtZ3_Xb96BCaoHyXs1sADTMNskAOKSUxDJaklCkzp2Fo8VVoJ0vx95K0rS=k-no"],"reply":"Hi Brent, thank you for the kind words and those great photos, the XTR 1906 looks fantastic out there in New Zealand! So glad it's helping you make beautiful memories. Enjoy the adventures ahead!\n\nThe Wonderland RV Team"},{"id":"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21GRE4wZENiWGRFY0ZORFQxcHlMVko2ZUdzM2JsRRAB","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21GRE4wZENiWGRFY0ZORFQxcHlMVko2ZUdzM2JsRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmFDN0dCbXdEcFNDT1pyLVJ6eGs3blE%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Keenan Elliott","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLVhJUT6mO7we_CsttGMfPGSr2MYHAQTP5EdVQm_rJETFJ7XA=s64-c-rp-mo-br100","date":"2026-04-27T23:37:26.327Z","stars":5,"text":"The Team at Wonderland and Outbound Rvs is great. Family friendly company that is there for the customer and you are not another number like the larger brands. Build quality is great and so is the service.","images":[],"reply":"Thank you so much for your kind words! We’re proud to be a family‑friendly team that truly puts our customers first. It means a lot to hear that our build quality and service stood out to you. Thanks for choosing Wonderland & Outbound RVs! \n\nCheers, \nWonderland RV"},{"id":"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21KS2VIVmFVMFIxUnpaTlRURlJabWxxY2xaNGQwRRAB","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21KS2VIVmFVMFIxUnpaTlRURlJabWxxY2xaNGQwRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmJKeHVaU0R1RzZNTTFRZmlqclZ4d0E%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Sandro Carboni","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKW8M8krDgGoV8RsGefyTp22h6tHkAGpkxLY0IoZFseG_3XwA=s64-c-rp-mo-br100","date":"2026-04-16T05:44:22.578Z","stars":5,"text":"The Wonderland team makes buying a new caravan an enjoyable experience. There was no high-pressure sales tactics as the product speaks for itself.  Nothing is issue and the pride and confidence the team have with their product is evident.\n\nWe were extremely pleased with the whole process from quote, design and build and would strongly recommend Wonderland to family and friends.\n\nWe picked up our Wonderland 22 XTR just over 2 weeks ago and could not be happier.  The attention to detail and build quality is exceptional to say the least.  This is our 5th caravan and I am sure we will be going back to Wonderland for our 6th based on our initial 2 small trips and the amazing team at Wonderland who will bend over backwards for you.\n\nThanks for the upcoming adventures,\nSandro & Teresa\nCruz & Wonder","images":["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLdsOB89SV3FoOj5cLFeGZ-evNH8NVNly7xPVbz3vAZjnR37afpvt-JuE1ImRIcuQYJQy6m3UL8ITG4iXIWMH70eHm8JFSi8I4C-7MRDQp3WRsFjLGuRbCLnevAy0hMuOawnsODSWELxJq_g=k-no"],"reply":"Thanks so much for the kind words, Sandro & Teresa!\n\nWe’re thrilled to hear how happy you are with your Wonderland 22 XTR and that the whole journey, from quote to build to delivery, was such a great experience. Knowing our no-pressure approach, attention to detail, and passion for what we do really came through means a lot to the entire team.\n\nHearing this from such experienced caravan owners is incredibly rewarding. We’re so glad your first trips have been a hit and can’t wait to see where all those upcoming adventures take you! \n\nCheers, \nWonderland RV"},{"id":"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pSR1kzTmlRME5YYkZjemVXUkdWazlTU1ZnMmMzYxAB","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pSR1kzTmlRME5YYkZjemVXUkdWazlTU1ZnMmMzYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjRGY3NiQ0NXbFczeWRGVk9SSVg2c3c%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Gjon gjolaj","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLJGrZvW3q989vC5SIvx24t0ZvEin6gRI2mdt12WNH2nGp6Ug=s64-c-rp-mo-br100","date":"2026-03-22T11:20:30.947Z","stars":5,"text":"We received our Wonderland Caravan a few months ago and we enjoyed already a few trips, it's amazing!\nOur van is a ultimate family caravan and the finishes are absolute premium quality.\nAll the Wonderland staff are very helpful and friendly.\nWe fully recommend Wonderland RV Caravans.","images":[],"reply":"Hi Gjon, \n\nThank you so much for sharing your experience with your new Wonderland RV! \n\nWe’re thrilled to hear you’ve already enjoyed a few trips and that the caravan is living up to your expectations. Knowing that the premium finishes, family‑friendly design, and overall quality have made a difference to your travels means a lot to our team.\n\nWe also really appreciate your kind words about our staff, the team will be delighted to hear your feedback.\n\nThank you for recommending Wonderland RV Caravans. Wishing you many more amazing adventures ahead!\n\nWonderland RV Family"},{"id":"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25Wb1IwVTVXSEo1ZDJacU1VeFFhVEJwWm1ac1ZVRRAB","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25Wb1IwVTVXSEo1ZDJacU1VeFFhVEJwWm1ac1ZVRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnVoR0U5WHJ5d2ZqMUxQaTBpZmZsVUE%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Dorina P","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIwJDnlfs89SBHah1wQYU9ha83F8aQlZtbg9kpec4ElrCBWFQ=s64-c-rp-mo-br100","date":"2026-02-26T21:23:22.009Z","stars":5,"text":"Excellent customer service, communication and the van quality is sublime.\nMe and my family highly recommend Wonderland RV Caravans","images":[],"reply":"Hello Dorina,\nThank you very much for your review. We hope you and your family make many memories in your Wonderland.\n\nBest wishes,\nThe Wonderland RV Team"},{"id":"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25wT2VXZElWazV2VHpWME1UQjNZVUZTUWpkU05HYxAB","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25wT2VXZElWazV2VHpWME1UQjNZVUZTUWpkU05HYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnpOeWdIVk5vTzV0MTB3YUFSQjdSNGc%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"office jasique","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIEkP9-wtscbViQ6vI7uzSX67TbpVZ2mtH-mzf906mnBqoeyg=s64-c-rp-mo-br100","date":"2026-01-26T09:19:24.598Z","stars":5,"text":"We’ve owned our Wonderland Amaroo for 12 months now and have absolutely loved it. It has truly lived up to its reputation and exceeded our expectations while we’ve explored Australia as a family. As a 4WD van, it’s been tough, reliable and comfortable no matter where we’ve taken it. The build quality from Wonderland RV has been outstanding, and the experience buying through Off Grid Outfitters was excellent. We wouldn’t hesitate to recommend both the van and the team behind it.","images":["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLfXGJbFdU4P73UqJsc0aXpht0RvyoV1iurJMqF5M1DaNDiULK3R25n7zOsan83SOf97dpkK5zjnMoiTDHLMKLqBPykKaXeEvf3bRBmncR35jJGoKX7gC1BumPvXQkPlrs0ePJqZ15vFelGL=k-no"],"reply":"Thank you so much for the fantastic review! We’re thrilled to hear how much you’ve loved your Wonderland Amaroo over the past 12 months and that it’s been such a reliable, comfortable companion for your family adventures around Australia. \n\nWe’ll also pass on your kind words to the team at Off Grid Outfitters. Thanks again for the recommendation 😊"},{"id":"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pabFJWaFdYemxoYUhsaFdVcFhlbGhVZDBVMWNsRRAB","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pabFJWaFdYemxoYUhsaFdVcFhlbGhVZDBVMWNsRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjZlRVhWXzlhaHlhWUpXelhUd0U1clE%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Jamie Culph","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIB6d3aIL9Eq-VF2ZcNbfWAnSfMWbuLpCZk3CN5NNe5urxdjQ=s64-c-rp-mo-br100","date":"2025-11-25T06:28:48.270Z","stars":5,"text":"Just purchased a 19.6 Amaroo for Off Road Caravan from Fab at Wonderland. Found the whole process to be easy and build time efficient. Regular inspections at the build factory In Cambeffield were never a problem and have been very satisfied with the experience. Although we have just started using at this stage, I would fully recommend a Wonderland Caravan.","images":["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLfWe6oXzem8CQyX8KXQQ-sZbnfLOIy6qyuZkVbNwrtI0l_1CNfz_ZL8hk-l4-6DG17kLhV1yJZFHQLfmmSd-RCH_QS7paCIx9cqeM0jp0qBaF6UrRCOA_Z1FzpNTO7go_Uf67xfVH82MpfI=k-no","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLdxm8x2I0QQh_gmftFkpORDaGbQ4sGgGN344QzeuY17VH7dpf9W4cXI4O7PRD2LoFEmUGP8finmYS_XUVzyrRuPF8C_yhnXlgFWbakhIZ2ojfNF0k6SqxaFo7wqqhBeSK7Qz_Lrlv4sjiK6=k-no","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLeBBsRkEu-9i7BAAhBjNYy256dHH5bRup9FmSFYuArWcnvv8X34IzBkMJfDEDYkb6N59BznWq0CyuR3WXDHoDcoPwZ74rmbbngHNSITprtt_bzAze1MxXTDVN3iVoF8X85luj8LhBKcPH0=k-no","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLdMby95X1zJ7fn1eFQ68WcWCl_dIH3XV6L_gVYWvoYysjOA2zjPm4GzsDKt_fY6czndirV1ql2atwS_Lvf3ez8l7piyqtBwH5ou701xnIZ3-48dHSiNmxWUzEGRnGMA5LI08iejErijBgUi=k-no"],"reply":"Hi Jamie,\nThank you so much for the kind words and glowing review! It's great to hear you had such a positive experience at our dealership, and that Fab looked after you so well. We'll pass on the kind words!\n\nEnjoy your new Amaroo, and we look forward to hearing about your adventures.\n\nBest Regards,\nThe Wonderland RV Team"},{"id":"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2poR2JXVXlSSFJtUzFScllXZExPVlE0ZHpkRVUzYxAB","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2poR2JXVXlSSFJtUzFScllXZExPVlE0ZHpkRVUzYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjhGbWUyRHRmS1RrYWdLOVQ4dzdEU3c%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Glenn Richo","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKD_P32dSF9Cf5IJG5N4aoP8YhFZvWckCBYT5IvNqxUKk2cXA=s64-c-rp-mo-br100","date":"2025-09-14T11:54:07.952Z","stars":5,"text":"Absolutely blown away with quality and service on our new amaroo! Special thanks to Fabian from sign up to delivery and everything in between could not fault your service and thanks wonderland for delivering our dream van!!!","images":[],"reply":"Hi Glenn, \n\nThanks so much for your kind words! We're thrilled you're loving your new Amaroo. We'll be sure to pass your feedback on to Fabian, he’ll really appreciate it.\n\nEnjoy every moment in your new caravan, and welcome to the Wonderland family!\n\nBest regards,\nThe Wonderland RV Team"},{"id":"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2twME1qZHlSM1I0VjFsaU9XRjVOV2RPWlZST1dFRRAB","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2twME1qZHlSM1I0VjFsaU9XRjVOV2RPWlZST1dFRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkp0MjdyR3R4V1liOWF5NWdOZVROWEE%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"trudi masalski","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKbtydmgQ2kFpdTIdZCvfcR8OXSoQrjevY-ZgC0UBndbdAxcw=s64-c-rp-mo-br100","date":"2025-08-19T23:44:06.436Z","stars":5,"text":"Excellent customer service, communication and the van quality is sublime - highly recommend","images":["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLfFtoCvurxnhT-4NeCrjjY7zpQPD4lsK4MXDCOQDGFV6HLPayEXlQPXKOUlKWiqe3ICzsZF5dyEQaqo7FrhoWVauCq__lTRe0geGPt0_uXGqryoIkUVqv-Tp53yr8cKfr2M6dnNi329IgUd=k-no","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLcR0EvrrDok3faKu9M5hdrAVbb_YAl5frrH9hk8k4dCOjfzsKjVFdgo2xwKcGm3N3hfUz_WdXLCmLVosYhpR39j_KkxAUryL5hz93aXNveYUtEH_dS2Adgh6Os1Ey0GAPAfdHfwqn0UjYTx=k-no","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLcfgRZQbUePq8n1dVTpYmSovQOv9PQ5F0F6-TfSKhAod9nMCptcdYvX-CKxfY_yg-t4Sz38hcuConhOIMZ2cWIxD4PyI4Ro1dUURmqnxOrFYO_vTlRaiTA-64bCp_X-ApaDzIO3zoEIKNU=k-no","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLfUyVSryq3DwSkBvaKPJQLjy5T8mNZnpSyAgypF__17RvhyvCmI6C7iItiKlG67ylkWAcCz817cu5TQtFaWt1l5OM18q6IKOsBKQfQPXWt49otoe6Ssl04i1eXkRFe-j9R54eDt_903c3gg=k-no"],"reply":"Hi Trudi, \nThank you so much for your kind words! We're thrilled to hear that you enjoyed the quality of our caravan and appreciated our customer service and communication. \nWe look forward to welcoming you again on your next adventure!\n\nBest regards, \nWonderland team."},{"id":"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21WTmRGaFJZbVJuY3pFMWJtazJiakV5YkZabE5tYxAB","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21WTmRGaFJZbVJuY3pFMWJtazJiakV5YkZabE5tYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmVNdFhRYmRnczE1bmk2bjEybFZlNmc%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Jill De Vos","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW1BwmjBIU6QLDniqxjgqrfwKHK0qR5frBBc8HY6EJfIjcKJqs=s64-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100","date":"2025-08-11T00:46:35.344Z","stars":5,"text":"I have just picked up my van from Wonderland after its 1000km service and I could not be more pleased with the service Josh provided. He goes over and above to help us! All the Wonderland staff are incredibly helpful and friendly, from the sales, after sale and service, I would not hesitate to recommend Wonderland.","images":[],"reply":"Hi Jill,\nThank you so much for your kind words and for trusting us with your 1000km service! We're thrilled to hear Josh and the rest of the Wonderland team made your experience a great one. We pride ourselves on going above and beyond, so it's fantastic to know that came through. Your recommendation means the world to us, we look forward to seeing you again down the road!"},{"id":"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT205aFFYaFJXa3RpUzAxV09EUnJjVk5XVmxONFlVRRAB","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT205aFFYaFJXa3RpUzAxV09EUnJjVk5XVmxONFlVRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOm9hQXhRWktiS01WODRrcVNWVlN4YUE%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Phillip Bromham","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKcamTzcak0EPG9K5GztJQd_VbTWh0esS7M-urRbmWH0XGAYg=s64-c-rp-mo-br100","date":"2025-06-26T11:50:47.370Z","stars":5,"text":"I would like to personally thank Josh at Wonderland for sorting out our water tanks in a very short schedule. Josh, your communication and customer service are next to none, your quality of work is off the chart and you saved our adventure because of your work ethic . Thanks you so much, I’d leave 10 stars for you if we could.\nWe made it to Keith and the van travelled like a dream. Thank you Josh!\nPhill & Helen","images":["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLemYOaVLK_zmkPCRgYJsgAuHB4nJwP40yzcw4YC91Fr1MqoAs-7BevdfVCmoSXGzviRNrSbKXX8KueAk8ObVGK6f8MB-8qIpfrn4uk_u4MeJx97pKJ9YHxCDpc1Un6OJzsC-tuFKW4QCdg=k-no"],"reply":"Hi, Phill & Helen. \n\nThanks so much for the kind words! We're thrilled Josh could help get back on the road so quickly. He'll be really pleased to hear your feedback. Safe travels, and we hope your adventures continue to be just as smooth!"},{"id":"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VNVzJvSm1Vay1Tb3BnRRAB","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VNVzJvSm1Vay1Tb3BnRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEMW2oJmUk-SopgE%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Michael Kelly","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWfmbYqD9wQPHD5KqBsZSSGZXxEdi1MDp-q8yOoBAlCWRlPh_Q=s64-c-rp-mo-br100","date":"2025-05-16T00:40:14.684Z","stars":5,"text":"I have owned my Wonderland for three years and it is great.","images":[],"reply":"Hi Michael, \n\nThank you so much for your kind words! We're thrilled to hear that you've been enjoying your Wonderland caravan for the past three years. It means a lot to us to have loyal customers like you. If you ever have any questions or need anything, feel free to reach out!"},{"id":"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNncFp6YTF3RRAB","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNncFp6YTF3RRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgMCgpZza1wE%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Mark Bates","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJPiWul-MbNYSeiUqo1FRDvNJn7mpr5ZkBdLcaviEw2l4-6HA=s64-c-rp-mo-br100","date":"2025-02-19T08:13:08.250Z","stars":5,"text":"Absolutely love our Wonderland RV Hornet! This is our second Wonderland we have owned and had this one custom built to suit our needs. An amazing company to deal with from design, manufacture and after sales support. Highly recommend Wonderland if you are considering your next van!","images":[],"reply":"Hi Mark,\nThank you so much for your kind words! We're thrilled to hear that you love your custom-built Wonderland RV Hornet and that this is your second Wonderland. It’s wonderful to know that our design and support have met your expectations. Your recommendation means a lot to us! If you ever need anything in the future, don’t hesitate to reach out.\n\nCheers, \nWonderland RV"},{"id":"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTURBbDlUVVJREAE","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTURBbDlUVVJREAE!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgMDAl9TURQ%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Mel","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKOLUHJmqsZrvwvDX9b4HljDHk2WIVWFjemB0jqGVibejhVhA=s64-c-rp-mo-br100","date":"2025-02-12T11:48:20.406Z","stars":5,"text":"Just want to praise the wonderland team.\nWe brought our van, coming up to a year ago, from the Ballarat (VIC) show, and we live in perth. The whole sale and transition over to perth was amazing and easy, thanks to Kevin and the team.\nSince owning the van we have had some minor warranty issues. This is where I think they go above and beyond.\nChristine has been exceptional to deal with, and nothing is too hard. With every issues been resolved in a timely manner with no hesitation.\nI can’t praise Wonderland enough, will definitely be leaning friends and family over to the good side 😃😃","images":[],"reply":"Thank you Maryellan for taking the time to write this review. We really appreciate it. It's great to hear that Kevin and Christine made your journey enjoyable and that any issues were resolved quickly.\n\nYour recommendation means the world to us. If you ever need anything else, please don’t hesitate to reach out.\nWishing you many happy adventures in your caravan!\n\nBest Regards, \nWonderland RV Team"},{"id":"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURfaktxVU5REAE","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURfaktxVU5REAE!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgID_jKqUNQ%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Brad Gaskell","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVIZujePfau0bo4UFIZz4pLR5IRCdo5BK_upuGJvy0KuhTX3aJZJg=s64-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100","date":"2025-01-22T04:01:10.546Z","stars":5,"text":"So glad we have joined the Wonderland Family. Could not be happier with our van.\nThe customer service and after sales service is second to none and the team are more than happy to assist in anything you need to help fix the issue.\nThanx again for an awesome experience.","images":[],"reply":"Dear Brad, \nThank you so much for the lovely review. We're thrilled to hear about your positive experience with Wonderland! Enjoy your beautiful van and the adventures ahead😊 If you need anything, just let us know!"},{"id":"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQzdzR6cE5nEAE","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQzdzR6cE5nEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgID3w4zpNg%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Sonia M","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLQC_LAhZ_y18AL0rGSs4DMsKmxA9l5t7BUBPNAD3_SUcS_ew=s64-c-rp-mo-br100","date":"2024-11-18T08:33:37.614Z","stars":5,"text":"After 2.5 years full time on the road we built a brand new Wonderland and couldn’t be happier with the sales, build, custom tweaks and especially after sales service. Every step of the way has been amazing with communication and response time. You have given us a beautiful van and we truly feel part of the Wonderland family. 👍","images":[],"reply":"Dear Sonia,\nThank you so much for the lovely review. We're thrilled to hear about your positive experience with Wonderland! Enjoy your beautiful van and the adventures ahead. 😊 If you need anything, just let us know!"},{"id":"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQ3NElTUllREAE","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQ3NElTUllREAE!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgID74ISRYQ%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Peter Pearce","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKj6BKreApvwx2Bavpl_1mlRoIKQVllYHbYfFDJBHtHikgVEw=s64-c-rp-mo-br100","date":"2024-08-20T05:00:20.472Z","stars":5,"text":"We purchased our Wonderland RV van in Sept 2021. (2206 Hornet - with 4 bunks). It was a bit of a bumpy start to our journey, with the build being not quite right, however with Kevin and Anna making the required corrections (no cost), the van has looked after my family (2A + 4kids) as we have explored Aus.\n\nAll the comforts of home with confidence. It’s been almost 3yrs of visiting remote campsites around the entire coast and up the middle of Aus. (Over 500 nights in the van and 60,000km).\n\nIt would be naive to think that with all this travel that the van would not encounter need for service. When we have found a problem we have always been very well supported with either warranty repairs or service provided by Wonderland after sales support by Christine Gioftsis.\n\nShe is amazing and has provided us with so much compassion, help and support arranging parts and repairs (when needed) from after sales support Wonderland RV.\n\nTakeaways from our experience:\n*communications is strong\n*solution focused\n*would we buy another Wonderland — YES!","images":[],"reply":"Thank you Peter for taking the time to write this review.  We appreciate it!  And most importantly, so happy to hear that you’re getting the most out your van with your family."},{"id":"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNibk5qaldBEAE","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNibk5qaldBEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICbnNjjWA%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Outbackandabout 4wd, camping and travelling","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVqLOOkP1hjspwC2S1b_B0YHAh1mVPGcUjGy-i6if9DPOb84tbr=s64-c-rp-mo-br100","date":"2024-07-24T11:29:59.043Z","stars":5,"text":"Wow,  what an amazing experience. Having purchased our 4th Van, 1st with Wonderland. Its been such a breeze. They bend over backwards through every stage of quote, purchasing, build, handover and most importantly After sales. Quality of build is next to none. Need a van, get a Wonderland!!!","images":[],"reply":"Thank you so much for taking the time to leave us this review.  We really appreciate it. \nWishing you many years of enjoyment with your caravan.  If you need anything, dont hesitate to reach out.\nBest Regards,\nWonderland RV Team"},{"id":"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURyeWEzUUlREAE","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURyeWEzUUlREAE!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDrya3QIQ%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Jason Moreschini","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKf3VgON70QPUR1EP3URv48Lk5-6DyvXbxjljh6IhupXavwHg=s64-c-rp-mo-br100","date":"2024-07-18T11:02:04.836Z","stars":5,"text":"I don't normally write reviews but this is a time that I must share our experience. We own a 2018 Amaroo/Hornet Wonderland Caravan which we purchased secondhand. We had a product problem (not a workmanship issue) and contacted Christine at Wonderland and mentioned our situation. Now bearing in mind the warranty period was well and truly finished we thought we would have Buckleys in getting anywhere with Wonderland. But quite the contrary, Christine was fantastic and in here energetic way dealt with our issue amazingly. Unbelievable. We are absolutely blown away by the support Wonderland have shown us and I tell you what, when we are ready to purchase another van I know where we will be looking first! Thanks Christine and Wonderland. Cheers Jason & Katrina","images":[],"reply":"Hi Jason & Katrina,\nThank you very much for the lovely review.  We appreciate you taking the time to share your experience as it means a lot to us. We'll be sure to pass your feedback onto Christine and the team. \nAnd if you need anything else, don't hesitate to reach out.\nWishing you happy travels!\nWonderland RV Team"},{"id":"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURUcDZ5U1J3EAE","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURUcDZ5U1J3EAE!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDTp6ySRw%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Andrew Richard","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLsLp2rIQsg-CrdiprO5wjL7M_QBWrG0xz2q_DT2DsDcarBUQ=s64-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100","date":"2024-05-28T22:48:59.994Z","stars":5,"text":"Can't recommend highly enough. Onto our second wonderland now and are absolutely stoked with it. Had a tiny little issue and the team from wonderland are straight onto it and had the issue fixed immediately. Great after sales service and the attention to detail is above all others. So happy with it, thanks so much to the team at wonderland","images":[]},{"id":"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURUNnBic3JRRRAB","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURUNnBic3JRRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDT6pbsrQE%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Leigh Dufty","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVpHEofy3Aer5dfozcrMVELUP55y2ojIUa0cfqfxvqxsCFklPxo=s64-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100","date":"2024-05-24T00:29:34.923Z","stars":5,"text":"Outstanding service.\nWe have purchased a second hand Wonderland, a new Wonderland & had our caravan serviced by Wonderland. The service in every department from sales through to service has been exceptional. Nothing is too hard and they really do look after their customers. If you are looking for a quality product with the service to match, Wonderland is my recommendation. We will be buying a 3rd Wonderland when we upgrade again.","images":[],"reply":"Thank you so much for the amazing feedback, Leigh! We're so glad you enjoyed your experience with the team and we look forward to helping you find your third Wonderland down the road.\n\nBest Regards,\nWonderland RV Customer Service"},{"id":"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURUck1TSURREAE","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURUck1TSURREAE!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDTrMSIDQ%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Colleen Blundy","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLE86nwi3AvMxX42tikcsyeOhKCw5dqAvCrP9b6_9Wehk6kFw=s64-c-rp-mo-br100","date":"2024-05-23T05:11:56.129Z","stars":5,"text":"A big thank you to all of the wonderful team at Wonderland Caravans! You have all gone above and beyond to meet our expectations on our custom made caravan. Your attention to detail and customer service has been excellent and it was a pleasure to build our beautiful caravan with you! Thanks again, Glenn & Colleen Blundy","images":[],"reply":"Thank you so much for this amazing review. It was a pleasure working with you to bring your dream caravan to life. We look forward to seeing you hit the road in your new home.\n\nBest Regards,\nWonderland RV Customer Service"},{"id":"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURqdWF5bFV3EAE","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURqdWF5bFV3EAE!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDjuaylUw%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Jerry Lewis","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIuZAgqX3kLkqhpuUWrdMLSKn79VhL18OqyGuCoe7y-fHEzLg=s64-c-rp-mo-br100","date":"2024-05-05T05:35:42.844Z","stars":5,"text":"Beautiful caravan excellent finish and service is one of the best","images":[],"reply":"Thank you so much for your five-star review, Jerry! It's lovely to hear that you are loving your caravan's finish and were well looked after."},{"id":"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNqOUtPUDdBRRAB","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNqOUtPUDdBRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICj9KOP7AE%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Brendan Billington","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI2Nb9-MCBW0tBT0_a2vWeo6YbQV_LRcY9rPQFfJLbS7TdjKQ=s64-c-rp-mo-br100","date":"2024-04-18T10:21:46.402Z","stars":5,"text":"Whilst searching for our family caravan to do a lap of Aus, we were looking into second hand caravans and both Ana and Christine were so willing and helpful with any questions we had. Once we purchased our second hand van Christine has been absolutely amazing with helping us sort out some minor issues with nothing being a hassle.\nWe can not praise or recommend both this company or the staff high enough and we are so appreciative of everything that has been done for us.\nWe are proud to be part of the Wonderland RV Family.","images":[],"reply":"Thank you so much for your lovely review, Brendan. We are so grateful to have you as part of the Wonderland RV family. Happy travels around Australia!"},{"id":"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURkb3NYbUl3EAE","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURkb3NYbUl3EAE!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDdosXmIw%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Sharni Miller","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU2TO-PAp8NvM01s93RDMOpoKMFpIudAwHJGztK-7hibOv_h5nV=s64-c-rp-mo-br100","date":"2024-02-22T03:15:55.675Z","stars":5,"text":"Absolutely love our wonderland caravan! We bought our wonderland amaroo 4 months ago and thoroughly enjoy our time in the van. The build and finishing touches are absolutely incredible and I would highly recommend wonderland caravans to everyone!","images":["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLdqDDTFdIPQ1Ivqq8GrtA7Tj2vLG8OBAOcSvokNKlV-VhGjDi4lN_v5INMlJexMzW0EbhTb0K77fACvnXInGTJxN79zCiVlTRPXAHrJJcvSTh6WxO-_aBm8xkzn988LDNw5gUHoVA=k-no"],"reply":"Thank you for your amazing review, Sharni. It's lovely to hear that you had a positive experience with our team. Safe travels and have fun making lifelong memories in your Wonderland!"},{"id":"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNOby1EUFJBEAE","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNOby1EUFJBEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICNo-DPRA%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Anthony Barr","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJzz60DZDTdwYqtlDZt7p65NRYXc_IetAstjkxjffE2ttcQuQ=s64-c-rp-mo-br100","date":"2024-01-17T10:41:35.515Z","stars":5,"text":"Hands down the best vans I have ever seen","images":[],"reply":"Hi Anthony, thank you so much for your five-star review. We are glad to hear that you are loving our Wonderland vans!"},{"id":"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQ1MnJhOTdRRRAB","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUQ1MnJhOTdRRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgID52ra97QE%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Christopher Barrett","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJBoTidjpAiNfkER6W_QyOHm3jureYIVCl-nc42FzrmO3EoMA=s64-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100","date":"2023-10-23T08:03:26.566Z","stars":5,"text":"We had our 2200 XTR serviced last week at Wonderland RV headquarters. This is by far, the best customer service we have received. We are currently on a lap of Oz and needed a couple of adjustments made to our van, which included a full re-silicon of the van(at our request) and a full service. Christine from the service department was so easy to deal with. Her communication was exemplary, and her and the service team, delivered our van back to us in amazing condition. Nothing was too much trouble for Christine, including waiting after hours for us to collect our van due to a delay with our car service. If you're buying a high end van, i think the point of difference is often what happens after the initial purchase. This is where, in our opinion, Wonderland RV has an edge over the competition. Thanks so much, Wonderland RV and Christine.","images":["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLcJbWxxZtDKLBuutU96OXsEKTnrV_3CCosULHH0g7h4Bh7q_g8pY-V4MxX61816Ke9LIpjGXvoWlBAwgCIoV-J-iMISWM12xPlFT7Nefp4ruG5Bot5f_IGr_Y_f8eNdGjZ_qVA=k-no","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLeCWl9bJE91wCJj3CeOtZzumX19X2yQKHjf88J03ABJrGNLc6ka7ADK8y5RM2xroJeEz1MTodwFy35zeIMQlp_bW3rs2xYFosQRXKZTvlrqFKtS9C5FCTG3bfHDJ48odADBLcBVQg=k-no"],"reply":"Hi Christopher. Thank you for your five-star review. It's wonderful to hear about your positive experience with the service at Wonderland RV headquarters. Thank you for choosing us and for your kind words about Christine and the team. Enjoy your adventures in your Wonderland van.\nCheers,\nWonderland RV"},{"id":"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUM1dGFYQUdnEAE","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUM1dGFYQUdnEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIC5taXAGg%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Adam SHARK","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLSSpnG5Y0Of6hM43ja2SA-nxVMXo-drLGQKIAb46TxpJTqhA=s64-c-rp-mo-br100","date":"2023-10-16T04:58:27.268Z","stars":5,"text":"We have our 2021, 21ft Amaroo from new and after nearly 2 years, I have to say that Wonderland RV are an absolute pleasure to deal with. Our van has been exceptional and managed to stay in amazing condition, compared to other van manufacturers! Absolutely love our van and the service Wonderland provide! Christine in service is so helpful and always makes you feel like an important  member of the Wonderland family.","images":[],"reply":"Hi Adam. Thank you for sharing your experience with us. We really appreciate it. Here's to enjoying many more adventures in your Amaroo!\nCheers,\nWonderland RV"},{"id":"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURwelBIamdnRRAB","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURwelBIamdnRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDpzPHjggE%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Shaz H","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocInQNpsioPn2tmcCIUq9dnQ1SZVUNN43mhbbk2SvyTnsR6iAaz-=s64-c-rp-mo-br100","date":"2023-08-17T12:45:40.729Z","stars":5,"text":"We could not be happier with our 2 1/2 year old Wonderland van, it’s quality and the ongoing level of service and support. The Wonderland team is exceptional, in particular….Christine in Service. We are currently out travelling in remote WA and really putting our van through its paces. We have only had minor issues but all have been rectified immediately by Wonderland. I would not hesitate in recommending a Wonderland caravan to anyone! 👍👍👍","images":[],"reply":"Hi Shaz, thank you so much for your lovely review. We are so glad to hear that you enjoyed your experience with our team. Cheers,\nWonderland RV"},{"id":"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR4cjRyalRREAE","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR4cjRyalRREAE!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDxr4rjTQ%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"John G","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX1eUCsONGhGOGmqKbrfBdYOiFbAMEOX76y9yrqbYeGa1VZxtHk=s64-c-rp-mo-br100","date":"2023-06-19T08:32:08.245Z","stars":5,"text":"We recently picked up our new Wonderland Amaroo and we’re loving it. The finish and fittings inside and out are quality. It is easy to use and very comfortable to live in.  The team at WL have been terrific, helping develop some customized features in our layout and following up promptly with after sales advice and assistance. WL have been a great to deal with, they have a professional approach to manufacturing and promote a respectful, attentive and helpful customer relationship. We are so looking forward to many happy adventures in our new van.","images":[],"reply":"Hi John, thank you so much for this five-star review. We are so glad to hear that you're loving your Wonderland Amaroo. Here's to many adventures in your caravan.\nCheers,\nWonderland RV"},{"id":"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN4OWUyR1FBEAE","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN4OWUyR1FBEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICx9e2GQA%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Alice Petrie","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJd6ZI_gtj291ECApeC8bSu_KW_26u76GEwYfVFACfObjXvng=s64-c-rp-mo-br100","date":"2023-05-23T02:02:18.856Z","stars":5,"text":"From securing our build spot to handover the Team at Wonderland RV were fantastic, professional and friendly. We could not be happier with the quality we have received, this makes living full time Van life feel like a proper home without compromising.","images":[],"reply":"Hi Alice,\nThank you so much for your lovely review. We are glad to hear that you are happy with the quality of your van and ultimately, that it feels like home, as it should. Enjoy your adventure!\nCheers,\nWonderland RV"},{"id":"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN4eGU2ZnJnRRAB","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN4eGU2ZnJnRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICxxe6frgE%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Carly Martyn","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJk_-jqVWpatLIMVUogPWTupZOJdtzhjRye5EUAm1lTa-12XQ=s64-c-rp-mo-br100","date":"2023-05-22T00:37:37.019Z","stars":5,"text":"We have been travelling in our Wonderland Adventus for six months now and we couldn't be happier. It's comfortable, moving days are a breeze, and the van quality is second to none. After service care has been exceptional and we are looking forward to many more adventures.","images":[],"reply":"Thank you Carly for your amazing review. We really appreciate it. \nSafe travels & have fun making lifelong memories in your Wonderland!\nCheers,\nWonderland RV"},{"id":"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN4NmNQQWp3RRAB","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN4NmNQQWp3RRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICx6cPAjwE%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Sarkis ELMADI","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLatlBjvjFK_WIMReSD9EgRTpYnyC4ZtO90mSi3PXst-QJOCQ=s64-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100","date":"2023-05-20T23:54:09.240Z","stars":5,"text":"After owing a wonderland I don’t think there is anything on the market that compares. Quality, workmanship, after service is 10/10. No shortcuts taken as everything is done right. I highly recommend if you are looking for a family caravan. Looking forward to our second trip.","images":[],"reply":"Hi Sarkis,\n\nThank you so much for taking the time to share your experience with us. It's lovely to hear that you appreciate the quality and workmanship as much as we do. We invest a lot of effort in our vans so our Wonderlanders can really experience adventure in comfort! Looking forward to hearing about your adventures. Cheers, Wonderland RV"},{"id":"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN4Z1phdVZ3EAE","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN4Z1phdVZ3EAE!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICxgZauVw%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"David Seddon","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIGe-metlvFIYO6UtMe6VbghF1V-sPPb7XL_zBwG9AfTrhhSw=s64-c-rp-mo-br100","date":"2023-05-18T22:59:47.025Z","stars":5,"text":"2017 van and last trip away, wife sat in van and said \"Still no regrets buying this van. All the time we've had it, still love it.\"\nThat sums it up. Wonderland great to deal with. Nice people too. Bonus. They always try to help.","images":[],"reply":"Hi David. Thank you so much for your lovely review. We love to hear that you have no regrets buying this van. We hope you get to build more lifelong memories exploring our beautiful country in it!\nCheers,\nWonderland RV"},{"id":"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN4M3Bfa3RRRRAB","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUN4M3Bfa3RRRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICx3p_ktQE%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"amanda burrow","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK3wMjUbpujlwbMrdukptcU1c9s5IGpLdaP80CFdJ79a6wPfQ=s64-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100","date":"2023-05-18T14:02:50.909Z","stars":5,"text":"We absolutely love our Wonderland XTR2200...from the chassis to the roof the van is superbly built and we've taken it on some pretty rough roads so far.  We live full time on our van and the things we love the most are\n1. Wireless airbag suspension\n2. Full height pantry\n3. Beautifully built cabinetry and quality upholstery throughout.\n4. Huge windows for amazing views.\n5. Wonderland RV after sales service.\nWe love meeting other \"Wonderlanders\" out on the road and love sharing our beautiful van with all the people we meet!","images":[],"reply":"Hi Amanda. Thanks so much for sharing your experience with us. We also love to meet fellow Wonderlanders like you on the road; we bet it was an amazing experience. Enjoy your adventures in your Wonderland van and don't forget to create lifelong memories on the road!\nCheers,\nWonderland RV"},{"id":"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURSemF5NVR3EAE","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURSemF5NVR3EAE!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDRzay5Tw%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Mandi Davies","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI4qCmfwvF8oGD7eVtHyGMLfIy8RYB1oTRF8IoFVuFUqXZLa_4=s64-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100","date":"2023-05-01T05:02:21.102Z","stars":5,"text":"We received our first Wonderland Quad Bunk over 12 months ago and can honestly say we've never looked back! Throughout the build process the team at Wonderland RV were absolutely amazing. There was so many options for selections it made my head spin - literally everything is possible! Our van is the ultimate family caravan and the finishes are absolute premium quality. We love hitting the road with our van any chance we get and often get comments from other travellers admiring the quality and finishes of our Wonderland. Only time we will be changing our van is to down size when the kids move out - and I can guarantee it will be for another Wonderland - there is no other van I would want!\nIf you're in the market for a new premium quality caravan, do yourself a favour and book a tour at the Wonderland showroom - you'll be converted like we were!","images":["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLdOoQLokktYt0ePeo4MvQUuiHrSVvgWm7NM-QYOAn7FEtZ723m_SaHcIRemoV1yejtvzKmvIVkq5chLnA0WvTRxeP2VrJuiCosVY81XgyMsJi36btC0e3GZ8MZIaiP0aR-iRLjdog=k-no","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLdpaPZc0UofuKlxE-5ldSyoLLICoRiwLcR1UZ0Tp0AjgVPDPWAzpkm9berUoPMfV4ASv5xNj1M8-ieJ__sGVKzyQ3r3ZmcRcUt1Wjcu2tpqjL-tARGu9154dqP_BVeAu2R96gyz=k-no","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLcgxiGumpc5hjjNl8GttG71oxVaaScSQHNUe4d_93VhcBV25_G85M9TG8Gm1DUorOLTafFNQfdtF_3WVHFMqQoKmM619NYZIX85d6v0n1ZR9M8rpRUkbl-BwVgMVIpyJpmuL3H1uQ=k-no","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLeh5VDdCowkmx4sl0R901JKGwoni_BE0TUOjkZWoti8nqD5YJJ5YEfzdWDDrTa93r06G3xce6HJVe5WH8-h6popLmN_CFHVBCR7IejKPaFbeyyPNB_EQlceACn80ASor9GLMzA=k-no"],"reply":"Hi Mandi, \n\nthank you so much for this lovely review. We are glad to hear that you love your Wonderland Quad Bunk caravan. It's such an amazing model! Thank you again for sharing your experience with us. Here's to many more happy travels in your van! \n\nCheers,\n\nWonderland RV"},{"id":"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURSeWNEMjNRRRAB","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURSeWNEMjNRRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDRycD23QE%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Kerstin Stringer","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXN-3IMwS_tlIun9uNpBRflKim-waadUDPw3iL4NYQ5zSUkZOM=s64-c-rp-mo-br100","date":"2023-04-28T06:04:13.019Z","stars":5,"text":"Wow - we have a 2021 XTR 21ft and we couldn’t be happier. We live full time in our van and have tried and tested all of the features and can truely say these vans are built well. Not only was the sale smooth and easy but the after care has been exceptional. Nothing is too much trouble for the team and they are always happy to help us. We have been amazed by this company and recommend them to everyone we speak to.","images":[],"reply":"Hi Kerstin,\nThank you so much for taking the time to share your experience with us. We really appreciate it. It's wonderful to hear that you are living full-time in your 2021 XTR 21ft! \nCheers,\nWonderland RV"},{"id":"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURCc2YyV1RREAE","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURCc2YyV1RREAE!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDBsf2WTQ%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"eduardo olmedo","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVGf4ukasi7t-lUOgleChrtuos1dDqTuLg7_Ki8N3quMfEo9LY=s64-c-rp-mo-br100","date":"2023-01-22T09:42:07.977Z","stars":5,"text":"Top noch caravans ... quality and performance,...","images":[]},{"id":"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR1eHJ5N3hnRRAB","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUR1eHJ5N3hnRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDuxry7xgE%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Jason Cornwall","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUxQw8u1Ke-Ay66PkWAgjaeXs6Jd_w1j5EkE2M3KyS_-yipKp0=s64-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100","date":"2022-08-19T12:35:49.821Z","stars":5,"text":"Best Caravan builder in Australia with excellent after sales service.","images":[],"reply":"Hi Jason,\nThank you for the review.  We really appreciate it.\nWe enjoyed working with you to build your van.\nCheers,\nWonderland RV"},{"id":"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUMyeTZmb05BEAE","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUMyeTZmb05BEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIC2y6foNA%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"WASTIN TIME WISELY","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWM86_YYrzvl-9UPznSEFtPODolJKIU8USUhJHezqL2rBVLYms=s64-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100","date":"2022-04-28T04:40:32.238Z","stars":5,"text":"One of the most down to earth companies we have delt with, there vans are second to none and the after sales service is about as good as it gets,","images":["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLfd_MsfVlVsUcF2DpEa6eICkjHGizM5yiRFm-5qyDLEoq8jgSZb66ncF-ZGYMrSJAJlGTsS-LN1a_owozMxB3DlgSDpy9R2_NLkRAvK_c9eM7ZlIpv45DGbouY2q0XMYTl3mDbW=k-no","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLczfJUYDv9CuxWZMVpV3VPQ6_ki-YjyZMyntekEYUNFUj2bLE2ha4IA6FieZhdJXXKsLMuWs_L1fMKQHJRSbQJvY5A4_fL0n9b5j___WaxSOyGSIRD2OoCJHn73gpdSyJGl5-phdQ=k-no","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLePsf68u9ICnuf4bvMjjCs2oPZPf2C5lpbmpktBiI8t5Nzs4Lic6T34eyCdqyRPALtYYSWY74bYhVih9hKUCHK-AgcTRfkcLjjuGGu_976MOQe0rzXgGPg09RJJlkTuiHgfAFwh=k-no","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLeh9JjJqVM3_WDXCh-NV1S-mh_heyx1qLW6_2cglfVSoHTgEK4DKuK9Wbdk-HX0hsq7rF4HX4IHNfZ0hiABkvXfUUkrLTUk1vnbbo6lbfnnsbY19KiE85WBy7NssFy1fG4iVTKLCg=k-no"],"reply":"Hi Michael,\n\nThanks so much for this five-star review. It's amazing to hear that you enjoyed your experience with our teams. We really appreciate it!\n\nCheers,\nWonderland RV"},{"id":"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNpaDlIamtRRRAB","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNpaDlIamtRRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICih9HjkQE%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Ann Dare","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIgajHMc1qWYdnxvKGo1eIvcso26Pkc9dGrLUZe-q-vc_UXig=s64-c-rp-mo-br100","date":"2020-11-17T06:59:43.103Z","stars":5,"text":"Always very pleasent to speak with.","images":[]},{"id":"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNpMHVtam1nRRAB","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNpMHVtam1nRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICi0umjmgE%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Ralph Watson","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWjkbVVmri-HyA9mOUvRFqlAY7FipMQ8IqBmNRzJev7qp6epsnX=s64-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100","date":"2020-10-27T11:31:03.763Z","stars":5,"text":"I have had two things happen and wonderland came straight back to us and put us in a lovely cabin while they fixed it up.  I have no complaints with the warranty. They are on it pronto. Lovely staff. Always there to help you out.","images":[],"reply":"Hi Ralph,\n\nThank you for the nice review! We really appreciate it. We are glad we could help you resolve your issue with your van!\n\nCheers,\nWonderland RV"},{"id":"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURjOGNqVktREAE","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURjOGNqVktREAE!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDc8cjVKQ%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Fabio Andrade","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXa6EmOUkOQZ7F-XJ-6am6r4RfIsOEtB__lnwNYhqCtgf2j9fzj=s64-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100","date":"2020-06-15T01:09:27.227Z","stars":5,"text":"What a company, fantastic family service awesome caravans. Happy we have signed up with them.","images":[]},{"id":"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURnak9iRVNBEAE","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURnak9iRVNBEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDgjObESA%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Gary Humphrey","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLOaFGo2aFu4UmzxA9IiCVo5DbLWdNmUjoSNNNtBYW8qttpRQ=s64-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100","date":"2018-05-29T02:17:20.315Z","stars":5,"text":"Great to deal with bought a Amaroo bunk 2100 May 18. Kev and Ana answered all my questions, I had a lot. I did the factory tour and was really impressed with the build quality and the attention to detail. The van turned out amazing.","images":[],"reply":"Hi Gary,\n\nThank you so much for taking the time to share your experience with us. We really appreciate it. It's lovely to hear that you had a great time with us and that your Amaroo Bunk 2100 turned out amazing!\n\nCheers,\nWonderland RV"},{"id":"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNRM09MY3BnRRAB","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNRM09MY3BnRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICQ3OLcpgE%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Amitha Wijesooriya","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJXHhS_tMcE2cLBWy1Z6_NMYoyFC9R6QPysnywJry_mglNe5g=s64-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100","date":"2017-05-22T05:30:22.865Z","stars":5,"text":"Strong and beautiful caravans....","images":[]},{"id":"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURRbXVuV093EAE","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURRbXVuV093EAE!2m1!1s0x0:0x334656952947021a!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDQmunWOw%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Susan Wilcox","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKi_y8fQtJTZwMoARfF1cfOAcRrS6Uy9wxAam8HyUaCtIpy8w=s64-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100","date":"2016-12-16T07:14:32.084Z","stars":5,"text":"What a pleasure to do business with Wonderland.\n\nFrom the first day we felt comfortable with Kevin and Rob - no hard sell or pressure -  just a willingness to listen and work with us to build our caravan exactly as we wanted. Nothing was too much trouble.\n\nKevin was always available and willing to discuss our queries and ideas ( and we had a few!)\n\nThe caravan is fantastic with a quality finish and an eye for detail that is exceptional. It was a nice surprise, too,  to find many of the expensive \"extras\"\nother manufacturers charge dearly for are standard features on a Wonderland van.\n\nAlthough they're  new kids on the block we have no hesitation recommending Wonderland.  Give Kevin a ring, we're sure  you won't be disappointed.\n\nThat's him doing the final touches!","images":["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLfoDRMq-YagkWCI-fADvwubBbHSwO5WwhALo7cifsIi2IOEl5pUvudzs47GEdbjiPRgB1ivom6LQ82txOhJOTdlou0fvqEkWPqcOxNC3Hej_7FXBuwboCDkp2XXmWbXdb4oLvE=k-no"],"reply":"Hi Susan,\nThank you so much for the amazing review. We really appreciate it!\nWe enjoyed working with you to build your caravan.\nCheers,\nWonderland RV"}]},{"key":"outbound","name":"Outbound RVs","placeId":"ChIJ73f3u5JP1moRGR33SZPkAfw","rating":5,"count":10,"writeReviewUrl":"https://search.google.com/local/writereview?placeid=ChIJ73f3u5JP1moRGR33SZPkAfw","avatar":"data:image/png;base64,","reviews":[{"id":"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT20xUU1rRlhhVjlpWW14TWVUQnpXSEZzWTJWVFZrRRAB","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT20xUU1rRlhhVjlpWW14TWVUQnpXSEZzWTJWVFZrRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xfc01e49349f71d19!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOm1QMkFXaV9iYmxMeTBzWHFsY2VTVkE%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Huia-Jade Hoori","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJy4Yo0FbtHepklGJka2g5m9D80Hug4AdqdG8gmZ44jU53HOw=s64-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100","date":"2026-11-13T01:49:19.519Z","stars":5,"text":"Amazing vans, amazing service, amazing communication. We look forward to traveling in our little house on wheels!!","images":[]},{"id":"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2psNVRWbHpOakpyT1cxdlgwMDJSelpKTW5CYVpGRRAB","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2psNVRWbHpOakpyT1cxdlgwMDJSelpKTW5CYVpGRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xfc01e49349f71d19!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjl5TVlzNjJrOW1vX002RzZJMnBaZFE%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Jeff Dee","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocID_Isgg84SF-jq_inZPmNc8JqzEb0rq-q1OZ9wiQQH7On76w=s64-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100","date":"2026-04-07T08:33:54.187Z","stars":5,"text":"Amazing customer service, we bought a used wonderland and were treated like we were buying a brand new one. A really professional team with a great knowledge of the industry, also very helpful with modifications to the van and a really in depth handover. Thank you so much Ana, Lloyd and co for making everything so easy.","images":[],"reply":"Thank you so much for the lovely feedback! We’re so glad you felt well looked after and that your Wonderland experience was a great one. Our team loves making the process easy, from modifications to handover. Ana, Lloyd and the team will really appreciate the shoutout. Wishing you lots of great adventures ahead!\n\nCheers,\nOutbound RVs"},{"id":"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tSU1gxVmlZMUJ3WVdkak0xQmFaRmQ2T1RaNVluYxAB","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tSU1gxVmlZMUJ3WVdkak0xQmFaRmQ2T1RaNVluYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xfc01e49349f71d19!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkRSX1ViY1BwYWdjM1BaZFd6OTZ5Ync%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Lisa Westmore","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUfaFSu1ZWAOTfpUEzjkWrLrSJDj4hrygXGDhDCr_UmcN6_SYj0=s64-c-rp-mo-br100","date":"2026-04-01T09:18:56.525Z","stars":5,"text":"Can not speak more highly of Fabian and Ana at Outbound RVs. They helped us design and build our dream van, going above and beyond, nothing was an issue.\nThe van has arrived and it has exceeded our expectations, the quality and finish is absolutely beautiful. Looking forward to making memories in our Wonderland.\nThanks Team","images":[],"reply":"Thank you for the lovely feedback!\n\nFabian and Ana will be so happy to hear this. We’re thrilled your Wonderland RV has exceeded expectations, it was a joy bringing your dream van to life 💚\n\nWishing you endless adventures and memories ahead. Thanks for choosing Outbound RVs!\n\nCheers, \nOutbound RVs"},{"id":"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2psS05YbGhlVFpvZGtwcVlsUk9WWFI2YUdjMWEzYxAB","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2psS05YbGhlVFpvZGtwcVlsUk9WWFI2YUdjMWEzYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xfc01e49349f71d19!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOjlKNXlheTZodkpqYlROVXR6aGc1a3c%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"WASTIN TIME WISELY","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWM86_YYrzvl-9UPznSEFtPODolJKIU8USUhJHezqL2rBVLYms=s64-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100","date":"2026-01-23T11:03:57.194Z","stars":5,"text":"One of the absolute best in the business,  these guys are so down to earth and genuine,  always willing to help and you would be hard pressed to find better quality product,  100% recommend","images":["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/AABkmLeRNMtTBUXB--v83_0gW0ULKOQM4HwijgbRSqvTx-nQafsVrI8cLL71qgdslSc0gI6Xb4krjMU7CJyy1-hX4Nx9MKI1Fes2be-RRh60fRAOm1m4PjfgDUo4dD6rdRqs5StUD4kB0hI6GgLt=k-no"],"reply":"Hi WASTIN TIME WISELY,\n\nThank you so much for your kind words! We’re thrilled to hear that you love our team and that you’ve had a positive experience with our customer service and support.\n\nIf there’s anything else we can do for you, please don’t hesitate to reach out.\nCheers,\nOutbound RVs"},{"id":"Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2w5Q1kwUnFjMUpKVjBGcVdWbDJWVzFyV0hobWQyYxAB","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2w5Q1kwUnFjMUpKVjBGcVdWbDJWVzFyV0hobWQyYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xfc01e49349f71d19!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOl9CY0Rqc1JJV0FqWVl2VW1rWHhmd2c%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Peter Caruana","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ2sM4uchLedZLIt8ZZ-Owj7TBihs0bItoJPOPjDncYVpafNg=s64-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100","date":"2025-06-20T02:25:50.482Z","stars":5,"text":"Great service,  it is good to speak to people who actually listen..","images":[],"reply":"Thanks, Peter! We're really glad you had a great experience with us, let us know if you need anything further in the future 😊\n\nCheers, \nOutbound RVs"},{"id":"ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VNZkp5TFRzbjZxUzV3RRAB","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VNZkp5TFRzbjZxUzV3RRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xfc01e49349f71d19!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEMfJyLTsn6qS5wE%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Lesley Gregory","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKLG-5Svx5EFqt2kZEgS6LRZGsIW-M0Udf0z2PRH_FBcjA4Rw=s64-c-rp-mo-br100","date":"2025-05-14T07:11:47.883Z","stars":5,"text":"Fabian was fantastic, great customer service, new van going well so far, couldn’t be happier, thanks Fabian and Team","images":[],"reply":"Hi Lesley,\n\nThank you so much for your kind words! We're thrilled to hear you're loving your new caravan and had a great experience with Fabian. We'll be sure to pass along your appreciation to him and the rest of the team. If you ever need anything in the future, don't hesitate to reach out."},{"id":"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNJXzdlZURREAE","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNJXzdlZURREAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xfc01e49349f71d19!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgMCI_7eeDQ%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Jarred Bissett","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUBeBaG_eluG51NE0qtxUbUXbcclYl2t-tCz8QjrypzpvTiSNsRc=s64-c-rp-mo-br100","date":"2025-04-06T00:33:45.800Z","stars":5,"text":"Love the team, great customer service and support","images":[],"reply":"Hi Jarred, \nThank you so much for your kind words! We’re thrilled to hear that you love our team and that you’ve had a positive experience with our customer service and support. \n\nIf there’s anything else we can do for you, please don’t hesitate to reach out.\nCheers, \nOutbound RVs"},{"id":"ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNRc2F2VGNnEAE","url":"https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNRc2F2VGNnEAE!2m1!1s0x0:0xfc01e49349f71d19!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgMCQsavTcg%7C%7C?hl=en-US","name":"Aaron Morrison","photo":"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUfaFSu1ZWAOTfpUEzjkWrLrSJDj4hrygXGDhDCr_UmcN6_SYj0=s64-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100","date":"2025-03-05T06:22:29.142Z","stars":5,"text":"Had my Zone RV van in the service department. Josh and Christine were brilliant. Josh ran through all the work before starting, including showing me what materials he was using and how he was going to perform the work. I was expecting to lose the van for three days, but all work carried out in the day and the van was vacuumed and wiped down where interior work was performed. Josh even shared before and after photos of all the work done.","images":[],"reply":"Hi, Aaron, \nThank you for your wonderful feedback! We’re thrilled to hear that Josh and Christine provided excellent service and kept you informed throughout the process. It’s great to know we met your expectations and got your Zone RV van back to you so quickly.\n\nWe appreciate your trust in us and look forward to serving you again!\n\nCheers, \nOutbound RVs"}]}]};
